// DEFAULT OPENCODE TUI GLOBAL CONFIG SETUP
// see: https://opencode.ai/docs/tui
// TODO: installer copy this file and reslove merge config exsting (`tui.json` or `tui.jsonc`) on global config opencode `"~/.config/opencode/`
